Ethics and Compliance Business Champions serve as the liaisons for the Ethics and Legal  Compliance group in business groups and sites across the company. They are responsible 
 for advocating and monitoring ethics and compliance, helping drive corporate initiatives, 
 and serving as local experts.

Read how Intel® AI technology is speeding up searches 
 for missing children in  Respecting Human Rights , 
 earlier in this section of the report.

We have identified and integrated six areas of ethical inquiry into our product 
 development and project approval processes related to AI capabilities: human  rights; human oversight; explainable use of AI; security, safety, and reliability; 
 personal privacy; and equity and inclusion.
